Generate appropriate YAML front matter for the following Markdown document.

Document content:
```markdown
{{current_content}}
```

{{#if schema}}
Schema to follow:
```json
{{schema}}
```
{{/if}}

Requirements:
- Include at minimum: title, description, tags, date, type
- Infer title from first heading if not obvious
- Extract or infer description from first paragraph
- Generate relevant tags from content
- Use current date in RFC3339 format
- Set type based on content (article, note, documentation, etc.)
- Output ONLY the YAML front matter block (including --- delimiters)
- No additional text or explanation